{"version":1,"content":"<p>中國正在將人工智能技術大規模引入基礎教育，試圖從小學階段開始培養能夠熟練使用AI、理解AI並利用AI進行創新的新一代人才。隨着近2億名中小學生逐步接觸人工智能課程，中國正在開展全球規模最大的AI輔助教育實驗之一，目標是在2030年前實現中小學生人工智能素養的普遍普及。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586632.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T11:57:19.754879+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T11:48:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T11:50:41.952134+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T11:50:41.952134+00:00","content_hash":"be5f86b7fbe6ce578f7a8e6cf67b941cdc208c01053bca74e4f4a5c3de46587c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}